  "caption": {
    "hashtags": [],
    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "I know your mind is trying to help you.\n\nIt’s trying to protect you from disappointment. It’s trying to make sure you don’t make mistakes. But you don’t have to listen to every scary thought it throws at you.\n\nYou don’t need to figure out your whole future right now. You don’t need to know exactly how everything is going to work out before you allow yourself to relax.\n\nYou’ve gotten through a lot of things you didn’t know how to handle until you were actually in them. And somehow, each time, you figured it out.\n\nI know it’s hard to trust that sometimes. I know uncertainty can make everything feel urgent. But not everything that feels urgent actually is.\n\nYou’re allowed to put some questions down for now.\n\nThe answers don’t always arrive when you’re searching for them. Sometimes they show up while you’re busy living your life.\n\nAnd I hope you remember this:\n\nYou have never needed to have everything figured out to keep moving forward.\n\nYou’ve always been allowed to learn as you go.",
    "word_count": 191
  },
